{"source":"Call Her Daddy: Jennifer Lawrence: Hunger Games, Hot Takes & Online Hate (PXagY52HcYQ), sentences 204-227 and their words, as clips-eval fetched them (2026-11-17)","sentences":{"204":{"first":1587,"last":1598,"start":452.3,"end":455.2,"speaker":"C","text":"There's a tornado in the city for the first time in decades."},"205":{"first":1599,"last":1613,"start":455.6,"end":460.8,"speaker":"C","text":"Like, it's just always so long and dramatic cuz I need to make it believable."},"206":{"first":1614,"last":1630,"start":461.3,"end":465.6,"speaker":"C","text":"But now I've gotten into a new place in my life where I just don't make plans."},"207":{"first":1631,"last":1634,"start":461.3,"end":463,"speaker":"B","text":"That's literally not believable."},"208":{"first":1635,"last":1651,"start":466.1,"end":470.1,"speaker":"C","text":"I just say no to absolutely everything and I haven't seen anyone in my life for years."},"209":{"first":1652,"last":1657,"start":470.8,"end":472.3,"speaker":"B","text":"Like, why do we do that?"},"210":{"first":1658,"last":1674,"start":472.3,"end":475.7,"speaker":"B","text":"My husband does the same thing where he's like, yo, man, like been a really crazy week."},"211":{"first":1675,"last":1678,"start":475.7,"end":476.5,"speaker":"B","text":"Like, can't make it."},"212":{"first":1679,"last":1690,"start":476.5,"end":479,"speaker":"B","text":"Like, I got want to just stay in with the wife tonight."},"213":{"first":1691,"last":1694,"start":479,"end":479.6,"speaker":"B","text":"And I'm literally like,"},"214":{"first":1695,"last":1695,"start":476.9,"end":477,"speaker":"C","text":"Yeah."},"215":{"first":1696,"last":1700,"start":480.1,"end":480.9,"speaker":"B","text":"how did you do that?"},"216":{"first":1701,"last":1705,"start":481,"end":482.2,"speaker":"C","text":"Like, are they so mad?"},"217":{"first":1706,"last":1717,"start":482.2,"end":486,"speaker":"C","text":"Which is weird because like it's normally something is like a projection."},